// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Basse Croupier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3186584284" "Basse Croupier"
// ProfessionString :
"P4189539807" "Casino Pit Boss"
// DescriptionString :
"P3662007695" "Basse Croupier had a promising singing career once upon a time, until a run of bad luck hit him hard and knocked him down for the count. A bankrupt record label, swindling managers, and several scandals ruined his career, leaving him destitute and on the street. His luck finally turned around when Johnny 'The Pipes' Sonata, the crooner most people had picked Basse to replace before his downfall, offered the down-on-his-luck singer a job at his casino in the Rogue Isles as a pit boss. Basse's been thankful to Johnny ever since, and has become of Sonata's most trusted men."
// HelloString :
"P1390257472" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Scoodie dooby doo... Oh, hey, {VillainName}!</a>"
// HelloString :
"P345832049" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Relax some, {VillainName}.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2087121753" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>What's happening, {VillainName}?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P511556878" "Hey, friend, I don't mean to offend, but I don't know you and I'm a busy man. You want an introduction, go see Johnny's enforcer, Hard Luck. He's always got jobs that need doing."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1348002457" "Hey, you gotta be {VillainName}. That's crazy, man. Totally crazy. I always meet the most incredible people at this job. Now, I've heard what people have said about you, but I'm not a judgmental type. I'm Basse Croupier, and I handle some of the work Johnny says needs to get done around here."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2960678099" "That's it, {VillainName}. That's all I have for you. But I know you're the kind of person with a lot more to do out there. You're gonna go places, I can feel it!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1712702272" "I think you might have a bit too much to do already, {VillainName}. Calm down, relax, get some of that stuff done. You don't want to over-do it, do you?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P567922117" "Ah, gee {VillainName}. I got something, but Johnny says he needs someone at least level {Level} to handle it. I mean, I think you could do it, don't get me wrong, but it's not my call to make."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2960179938" "You've done pretty good, {VillainName}. You're a real asset, you know? Take my private number. And take a look at these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Enhancements</a> I've got."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1884485734" "You're doing great, {VillainName}. Fantastic. You're a real performer, a real show-stopper! A mover and shaker like you needs the best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1643616552" "Thanks for dropping by, {VillainName}. But the thing is, you're a real big-shot now. You probably shouldn't waste your time hanging out with small-fry like me. It'll make you look bad. So go on. Get out of here and go make it big. You're big-time now. Get out there and show it."
// LocationString :
"P3437209096" "St. Martial"
// IntroString :
"P3868864396" "Basse Croupier used to a an up-and-coming crooner, once upon a time. He hit a big streak of bad luck which ended his career. Johnny Sonata offered him a job as a pit-boss at the Golden Giza, and now he's as loyal as they come. If Basse has something for you to do, you know that it's because Johnny wants it done. He can get you Natural and Technology Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3209022957" "Choose Basse Croupier"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2490336613" "Basse won't steer you wrong. Oh, and his name's pronounced 'Bay-see'. He'll never correct you on it, though. He's funny that way."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P919404896" "Hey, I know someone who wants to know you, {VillainName}."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P727921600" "Hey, I know some people who are interested in knowing you, {VillainName}."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


