// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Jezebel Jones 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1358542333" "Jezebel Jones"
// ProfessionString :
"P3104964679" "Casino Madam"
// DescriptionString :
"P86724573" "This vision of beauty runs Johnny Sonata's favorite escort service. This has given her a great deal of pull, even within the upper echelons of Arachnos. Though many consider her just one of Johnny's hangers-on, her access, charm, and willingness to seduce and manipulate give her a dangerous level of power that most people don't appreciate."
// HelloString :
"P438116879" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's get busy.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P161266882" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>This is serious business.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2223497120" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Honey, we've got work to do.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3567830494" "We haven't been properly introduced. I suggest you speak with Vivacious Verandi. She's low class and unpredictable, but anyone who can do her dirty work has the guts to succeed here in St. Martial."
// FirstVisitString :
"P924687765" "Darling, you may think you're important in the Rogue Isles, but I'm here to tell you you've got a lot to learn. I engage in a very deadly business, and it isn't everyone who has what it takes to deal with me."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1022726150" "There's nothing here that I can't handle. You should ask someone else if you need a job."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1293068834" "You're a busy bee. Don't look for more work until you clear that plate."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4107991007" "I can't trust this job to anyone below Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3457416683" "I think I can trust you a little farther, {VillainName}. You may have access to a wider selection of <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a> Give me a call sometime, sugar."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3127123456" "You've proved you can be trusted. For now at least. Take these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements;</a> I hope they do you some good."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1891880399" "I'm sorry, but I've got everything taken care of here. You should be looking for bigger opportunities."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P468124532" "You should definitely look up Jezebel Jones. The lady has style, plus all the inside information on the Golden Giza. Jez has access to Mutant and Magic Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3809949846" "Choose Jezebel Jones"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2089809056" "Jezebel and I aren't close, but I love her outfit!"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3739576997" "I've been asked to pass you along to <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>some people</a> I know."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1546977907" "I've been asked to pass you along to <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</a> I know."
