// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Johnny_Sonata 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Johnny Sonata 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1831386631" "Johnny Sonata"
// ProfessionString :
"P581804845" "Smooth-singing owner of the Golden Giza"
// DescriptionString :
"P4235159622" "He's the top of the heap, the big cheese, the man himself: Johnny Sonata. Everyone knows who Johnny Sonata is. He sung his way up in the world with his golden voice and charming smile. While he still releases platinum-selling albums every year, he spends much of his time running his casino, the Golden Giza. Johnny is an extremely powerful man, and there are many rumors that say he's tied both the  Family and to Arachnos."
// HelloString :
"P781602372" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hey there, kid!</a>"
// HelloString :
"P4217356449" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>How ya doin', kid?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P870708126" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>What's happnenin', kid?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3560031136" "I like your initiative kid, but I don't know ya, and I ain't got time for ya right now."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2867382289" "Basse tells me you're a good kid, {VillainName}, and I trust his judgment. So, if he says you're all right, you're all right by me. And there's a couple things I need someone I can trust to do for me."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3833614887" "We're done, {VillainName}. I got no problem with ya, and you should know it ain't worth it to have a problem with me. You got paid, and now that it's all over, I think I came out better than I coulda' hoped!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P570402265" "You need to finish some of the things you already have on your plate, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2715980364" "Basse says you're okay, but I think yer gonna need a little more oomph to do what I need ta get done. Come back when you got a Threat Level a' {Level} and then, I can talk to ya."
// BadgeNeededString :
"P2326940399" "You ain't got the glitz, kid. How do I know you got what it takes to really stick to your guns?"
// BadgeFirstTick :
"P550064425" "You need a heck of a lot more badges before we can deal. Fifty, minimum."
// BadgeSecondTick :
"P3624812982" "You got to pick up some more badges before we can talk. Fifty, no less."
// BadgeFourthTick :
"P3551470289" "Ok, I'll admit it, you're showing me some moxie. Bring your badge total up to fifty, and we'll talk."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P828963593" "I like you, kid. You're a go-getter. I like that kind of drive. Check out my latest <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a> Hey, you want to talk to me, you talk to me. Any time you like."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3000537831" "You're a real star, kid, a real class act. You need the best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> to keep up with the kind of action you'll see."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2535643588" "I'm the biggest thing there is, kid, but you got a lot more to do. So quit hangin' around here! Get outta here and go make your big play!"
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1675820371" "Johnny's the biggest thing there is, man. He's the coolest cat in the world. And he wants to talk to you about somethin' big. Johnny can get you Magic and Natural Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1580583422" "Talk to Johnny Sonata"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3399269815" "Johnny's the man, {VillainName}. If he wants to talk to you about something, then man-oh-man, it's gotta be important."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P686411595" "Hey, if you're seein' this, then something's probably wrong, 'cuz Johnny Sonata doesn't introduce nobody."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

